        "attribution": "Toner, Ramaswamy, and Vicsek are associated with complementary theoretical and model-building foundations. Their respective contributions should be mapped carefully before fixing the prize citation.",
        "maturity": "The field has matured into a substantial body of theory and experiment, though its unifying framework and reach across active systems are still developing.",
